  "content": "<p>BBL 色彩 - 連接材質</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此資源包為 BBL Colors 模組中的部分方塊添加了連接材質，模組來源如下</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bbl-colors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bbl-colors</a><br><br></p><p>它使用 Fusion 模組來創建這些材質，來源如下<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures</a></p><p>目前支援道路、馬賽克、包覆與拋光石材等變體。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271095/description_cbc7a853-d041-4f7d-b757-a4b7617b366c.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271095/description_3a9bad5f-3085-4dc5-9407-33d7d14c14c7.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1271095/description_656e5256-c7d1-42b5-8aec-b685035345a3.png\"></p>",
